-- Asserting a snapshot: find the old one, compare, report, and store the new
-- one as the environment says. The crate's `src/runtime.rs` and `src/env.rs`.
--
-- Rust gives insta the test's name, file and line; Meadow does not, so a
-- snapshot is named by the caller and placed by `Settings`.
--
